+<section class="context" aria-label="Agent operational context">
+  <header><div><h3>Agent activity</h3><small>Enquiry and reservation are independent · Appointment times in UTC</small></div><button *ngIf="!context" (click)="refresh()" [disabled]="loading">{{loading?'Loading…':'Refresh'}}</button></header>
+  <p *ngIf="error" class="alert" role="alert">{{error}}</p><p *ngIf="notice" class="notice" role="status">{{notice}}</p>
+  <ng-container *ngIf="data as c">
+    <p *ngIf="c.scope_limited" class="notice">Only information permitted for this selection is shown. Historical or restricted enquiry context is unavailable.</p>
+    <div class="status"><strong>Chat: {{label(c.chat?.status)}}</strong><span>Follow-ups: {{label(c.chat?.cadence)}}<ng-container *ngIf="c.chat?.cadence_reason"> · {{label(c.chat.cadence_reason)}}</ng-container></span></div>
+    <p *ngIf="c.chat?.pause_reason" class="alert">{{c.chat.pause_reason}}</p>
+    <p *ngIf="c.execution&&!c.scope_limited" class="execution">Dialogue runtime: {{c.execution.new_engine_selected?'selected':'not selected'}} · New flow: {{c.execution.new_flow_enabled?'selected for this project':'not selected (legacy routing may apply)'}} · Project: {{c.execution.project_ready?'ready':'requires configuration review'}}<ng-container *ngIf="c.execution.job_status"> · Inbound work: {{label(c.execution.job_status)}}<ng-container *ngIf="c.execution.job_error"> · {{c.execution.job_error}}</ng-container></ng-container></p>
+    <p *ngIf="!c.trace?.engine&&!c.scope_limited"><small>No validated agent run has been recorded for this opportunity yet.</small></p>
+    <div class="property-grid">
+      <article><h4>Current enquiry</h4><p>{{c.current_interest?.project_name||'No visible enquiry'}}</p><strong>{{c.current_interest?.property||'No property selected'}}</strong><p *ngIf="c.current_interest?.unit">Unit {{c.current_interest.unit}}</p><small>Asking about another property does not change a visit.</small></article>
+      <article><h4>Recorded visits</h4><p *ngIf="!c.appointments?.length">No visits recorded for this selection.</p>
+        <div class="visit" *ngFor="let v of c.appointments"><strong>{{v.project_name}} · {{v.property_type_name||'Property not recorded'}}<ng-container *ngIf="v.unit_code"> · {{v.unit_code}}</ng-container></strong><p>{{utc(v.starts_at_utc)|date:'medium':'UTC'}} UTC · {{label(v.status)}}<ng-container *ngIf="v.confirmation_status==='rescheduled'"> (replaced)</ng-container></p><p>{{v.specialist_name||'Specialist not recorded'}} · {{v.duration_minutes}} min</p><p>{{v.address||'Address not recorded'}}</p><small>Calendar: {{label(v.calendar_status)}}</small></div>
+      </article>
+    </div>
+    <details *ngIf="c.proposals?.length"><summary>Pending proposals ({{c.proposals.length}})</summary><article *ngFor="let p of c.proposals"><strong>{{label(p.kind)}} · {{p.project_name}} · {{p.property||'Property not recorded'}}</strong><p>{{label(p.status)}} · {{utc(p.starts_at)|date:'medium':'UTC'}} UTC</p><p>{{p.specialist}} · Expires {{utc(p.expires_at)|date:'short':'UTC'}} UTC</p><small>A proposal is not a confirmed reservation.</small></article></details>
+    <details *ngIf="c.waits?.length"><summary>Availability requests ({{c.waits.length}})</summary><article *ngFor="let w of c.waits"><strong>{{w.project_name}} · {{w.property||'Property not recorded'}}</strong><p>{{w.date_from}} to {{w.date_until}} · {{w.timezone}} · {{w.channel}}</p><p>{{label(w.status)}}<ng-container *ngIf="w.close_reason"> · {{label(w.close_reason)}}</ng-container></p><small *ngIf="w.last_error">{{w.last_error}} · Next check {{utc(w.next_check_at)|date:'short':'UTC'}} UTC</small><p *ngIf="w.status==='review'" class="alert">Review the provider receipt before any new contact; automatic resend is stopped.</p></article></details>
+    <details *ngIf="c.effects?.length"><summary>Synchronization and receipts ({{c.effects.length}})</summary><label *ngIf="canManage&&conversationId">Reason for synchronization retry<input [(ngModel)]="note" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Explain what was reviewed"></label><article *ngFor="let e of c.effects"><strong>{{label(e.kind)}} · {{label(e.status)}}</strong><p>Attempts: {{e.attempts}}<ng-container *ngIf="e.last_error"> · {{e.last_error}}</ng-container></p><small>Next check: {{utc(e.next_attempt_at)|date:'short':'UTC'}} UTC</small><button *ngIf="canRetry(e)" (click)="retry(e)" [disabled]="retrying||note.trim().length<3">Retry failed synchronization</button></article></details>
+    <details *ngIf="c.interventions?.length||c.moderation?.length"><summary>Intervention and moderation</summary><article *ngFor="let i of c.interventions"><strong>{{label(i.reason)}} · {{label(i.status)}}</strong><p>{{i.evidence}}</p><p *ngIf="i.resolution">Review: {{i.resolution.note}} · {{i.resolution.reviewer_name}}</p></article><article *ngFor="let m of c.moderation"><strong>{{label(m.category)}} · {{label(m.disposition)}}</strong><p>{{m.evidence}}</p><small>{{m.warning_accepted_at?'Warning accepted by provider':'No accepted warning receipt'}}<ng-container *ngIf="m.dismissed_at"> · Reviewed false positive</ng-container></small></article><small>Reviewing an incident never restores withdrawn consent or disables safety checks.</small></details>
+    <details *ngIf="c.tasks?.length"><summary>Conversation tasks ({{c.tasks.length}})</summary><p *ngFor="let t of c.tasks">{{label(t.topic)}} · {{label(t.status)}}<ng-container *ngIf="t.blocked_reason"> · {{t.blocked_reason}}</ng-container></p></details>
+    <details *ngIf="c.trace?.engine"><summary>Validated trace</summary><p>{{c.trace.engine}} · {{c.trace.model||'Model unavailable'}} · {{label(c.trace.run_status)}}</p><p *ngIf="c.trace.error_code" class="alert">Processing error: {{c.trace.error_code}}. Review or retry the affected turn; the conversation status is shown above.</p><p>Last response: {{label(c.trace.last_message_status)}}</p><small>Provider acceptance does not confirm delivery to the phone. Private model reasoning and credentials are excluded.</small><h4>Configuration reference</h4><pre>{{c.trace.configuration|json}}</pre><h4>Language validation</h4><pre>{{c.trace.language_validation|json}}</pre><h4>Approved action policy</h4><pre>{{c.trace.action_policy|json}}</pre></details>
+  </ng-container>
+</section>
